  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math>, for which the system of equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math> has no solution. Then,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "24",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>System of equations,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>For no solution&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
